Rangers can't #twoweapon so that covers your main arsenal.

To storm the Castle consider leaving most of your items in your
cache at camp and only bring armor, weapons, "oR, rings, wands,
luckstone and a few important tools.  Bring every dagger you
can without being burdened.  If you can carry bow and arrows
in addition to your daggers, do that and e(x)change the bow as
your secondary weapon.

Then open the bridge using the pass-tune, playing Mastermind,
or a spell.  As the monsters file out machine gun them with
your daggers until either the monsters of daggers run out.
Switch to bow and arrows until your arrows run out.  There
shouldn't be that many monsters left to take out with
Greyswandir by the time you're run out of both.

Make sure you've taken out any L with remote fire.  Once
